 *   **Isovalue:** The threshold value for isosurface extraction. Vertices with values below this are considered inside [S1, unofficial].
 *   **Chunk Size:** (Optional) The number of points processed in each iteration of the implicit function evaluation loop to limit GPU memory usage. Default value in some implementations: 262144 [S2, unofficial].
